      <p class="location-intro">The School is based in an atelier at Schönau Areal in Wetzikon-Zürich. Visits can be arranged individually. Access is arranged through conversation, not unrestricted public entry.</p>
      <p class="location-intro">A full workstation directory ships in a later phase. The seven stations — BioLab, Makerspace, Dirty Workshop, Electronics Bench &amp; Wearables Lab, Office, Studio and Saloon — support interconnected investigations rather than isolated departments.</p>
